1. Data Acquisition

    Dataset: We'll use the IBM HR Analytics Employee Attrition & Performance dataset, which contains various features related to employee demographics, job roles, and performance metrics.

    Source: You can download the dataset from IBM HR Analytics Employee Attrition & Performance.

2. Data Preprocessing

    Load Data:

  import pandas as pd

  df = pd.read_csv('WA_Fn-UseC_-HR-Employee-Attrition.csv')

  Inspect Data:

  df.head()
  df.info()
  df.describe()

  Handle Missing Values:

   df.isnull().sum()

